  "rule": "Ontology meaning is read through core.ontology_loader.load_ontology and the closure's semantic_index. A direct rdflib parse is for syntax, IRIs, imports, declarations, or non-ontology inputs, and every one is listed here with its reason. tests/test_dd103_closure_boundary.py enforces it.",
